  "releaseNotes": "2.3.0 adds CursesRasterAtlas: exact cell-pixel geometry, bounded double-buffered RGB24/RGBA32 tile updates, retained rectangular projection, conservative lifecycle ownership, explicit recreation/fallback guidance, and complete-frame refresh through verified ordinary Kitty/Sixel output. The 2.0 assembly version remains stable and the sole direct runtime dependency is Icod.Terminal 1.28.0.",
